[SPEAKER_02]: No, you never have either.

05:23.191 --> 05:24.452
[SPEAKER_02]: It's a whaling town.

05:24.612 --> 05:28.395
[SPEAKER_02]: A whaling town that has docks that are fit for nothing but fishing.

05:29.535 --> 05:40.182
