[SPEAKER_02]: But in the marketplace, I make quite a bit of money.

06:11.041 --> 06:14.802
[SPEAKER_02]: I'm looking for foods, oils, things everybody needs in this town.

06:14.842 --> 06:18.083
[SPEAKER_02]: I'm doing my small bit for Monmurg.

06:18.123 --> 06:18.763
[SPEAKER_00]: How does it work?

06:19.844 --> 06:20.344
[SPEAKER_00]: No doubt.

06:20.764 --> 06:21.324
[SPEAKER_00]: No doubt.

06:24.305 --> 06:25.725
[SPEAKER_00]: And the money isn't bad either, I bet.

06:25.786 --> 06:26.666
[SPEAKER_00]: Money's not bad.

06:26.706 --> 06:27.026
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

06:28.767 --> 06:30.087
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, this would be an interesting way.

06:30.107 --> 06:32.768
[SPEAKER_00]: I think there's an opportunity to get more

