06:57.285 --> 06:57.745
[SPEAKER_00]: Who knows?

06:58.145 --> 06:59.566
[SPEAKER_00]: The brooding boy is off somewhere.

06:59.586 --> 07:00.987
[SPEAKER_00]: Probably hiding in a corner somewhere.

07:01.047 --> 07:07.210
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, to be honest with the two of you, I was actually looking for him because he knows these waters as well as anyone.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.491
[SPEAKER_02]: Better even than me, even.

07:08.911 --> 07:11.432
