07:27.835 --> 07:34.379
[SPEAKER_02]: I'm going to be in town for a couple of days, yes, but I'm going to be making my way back to Red Shore in some time.

07:35.740 --> 07:43.245
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, we'll definitely be seeing him and maybe we can get to him together with you.

07:44.326 --> 07:45.727
