11:59.193 --> 12:00.974
[SPEAKER_02]: Anyway, we ran down the coast.

12:01.655 --> 12:04.577
[SPEAKER_02]: We were able to make ourselves the salt marsh and then on to Seaton.

12:04.997 --> 12:09.060
[SPEAKER_02]: And from there, it was just a couple of friends that I was able to hook up with.

12:09.741 --> 12:11.882
