12:13.664 --> 12:13.884
[SPEAKER_00]: Wow.

12:14.404 --> 12:14.744
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes.

12:15.905 --> 12:16.626
[SPEAKER_00]: Quite the adventure.

12:17.887 --> 12:18.928
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, definitely lucky.

12:20.749 --> 12:21.950
[SPEAKER_00]: So then you decided to score some

